tips=[
('Make every financial number traceable','Retain the entity, period, units, currency, source version, and calculation path. A correct citation can still point to the wrong period or denominator. Distinguish sourced figures from calculated results and forecasts.',[kepler]),
('Keep freshness and access separate','Ask both whether a fact is still authoritative and whether the current user may see it. Test revocation and conflicting updates, alongside retrieval relevance. A better answer score cannot compensate for an entitlement error.',themes[0]['sessionIds']),
('Evaluate the work product people accept','For research, measure an accepted memo or useful signal. For advisors, measure a prepared meeting or accurate follow-up. Include the human corrections needed before use; a completed model response is only one step.', ['ae273f0b-db0f-4638-8ae3-05874bebf9ca']),
('Use ablations to explain improvement','Remove or vary context, memory, tools, and model independently on the same task set. Record when an addition hurts. Preserve reusable procedure separately from case-specific facts that may become stale.', ['4607dbbe-8f94-4b0e-91ce-257d1cfb5448']),
('Inspect false passes in automated judging','An evaluator agreeing on easy cases may miss the failures that matter. Ask for important disagreements, the adjudication method, and thresholds for keeping human review. Recheck after model or workload changes.', ['ece6925c-c979-483f-bd40-51eacdbbe11b']),
('Specify necessary intermediate behavior','Evaluate essential steps as well as final outputs: authoritative evidence consulted, required approval obtained, and exceptions handled. A lucky correct answer can conceal an unacceptable process.', ['1cbc625f-7f07-49bb-9c5c-57c95f07ba77']),
('Draw the authority boundary','Describe the requesting identity, accessible data, allowed actions, policy enforcement point, and human exceptions. Test denied and duplicate actions. Human review should have a clear responsibility and usable evidence.', ['ac709f86-ce51-4582-a680-70449c32d29c']),
('Treat long-running work as a case','Capture state, owners, pending events, evidence, and handoff conditions. Ask how an interrupted case resumes and how duplicated signals are handled. Duration alone does not require one continuously running model session.', ['75bd85ed-b49d-41f6-98e1-7a22853c18ab']),
('Compare cost per accepted task','Include inference, retries, tools, review, rework, support, and maintenance. Choose lower-cost models only after they meet the relevant task and critical-failure requirements. Keep cost estimates separate from realized savings.', ['272a7ef0-4b78-41a3-813d-a67361fcd2d3']),
('Give experiments an exit decision','Name an owner, required telemetry, graduation criteria, and a retirement condition. The supported path should make common work convenient while experiments generate evidence about whether they deserve ongoing support.', ['272a7ef0-4b78-41a3-813d-a67361fcd2d3','58fe4b11-571e-4afd-bd89-8ad63e6cfe11']),
('Protect domain invariants during modernization','Document reconciliation, completeness, idempotency, permissions, and downstream behavior. Ask which improvements came from AI and which came from migration design or expert knowledge. Faster generation increases the need for focused validation.', ['1779b934-d67b-45e9-ba11-0b19efac4b7e','6b92fb75-064e-4cb5-8aa3-7c7f211e7420']),
('Keep an evidence ladder for every benefit','Write down usage, useful work, process change, and financial outcome separately. Define a comparison and full operating costs. In investment research, preserve point-in-time inputs and idea lineage to avoid reconstructing success with hindsight.', ['ae273f0b-db0f-4638-8ae3-05874bebf9ca','5049757d-8a2e-46fd-9d7b-c8c1f3d7b72a'])]
# Refresh selected practical tips from actual attendee notes.
tips[1]=('Separate agent recall from human-facing usefulness','Scope the time period and decision, then evaluate retrieval coverage separately from final-brief relevance and noise. A shared repository does not require identical retrieval or presentation for people and agents.',['a84ca3a8-cc2f-4b50-a635-fc380f6f04f6'])
tips[5]=('Test the consequential failure path','Seek disconfirming cases. Test containment, detection, and human intervention alongside output quality; preserve found failures as regression cases and verify repairs on a separate assessment set. Frequency alone does not describe risk.',['9d72d7ac-a2a2-42cf-b880-5859316d840c'])
tips[6]=('Connect the registry to enforced boundaries','Record owners, tools, endpoints, and resources, then test allowed and denied actions. For selective approval, measure missed consequential cases as well as unnecessary interruptions.',['73badd10-6f8c-4c95-b5e7-55fc3d7bafc1'])
tips[10]=('Separate maintainability from immediate consequence','Ask who depends on a tool and how long it must live. Rapid replacement may justify less long-term maintenance, while a wrong financial result or sensitive-data exposure can still matter immediately.',['5191589c-a70e-4806-99dc-86f7794f46b9'])
tips[11]=('Make traces usable for verified improvement','Connect request context, actions, evidence, outcomes, and evaluation results. An automated diagnosis is a hypothesis: reproduce the issue, assess a fix, and retain an accountable release decision.',['b2ed4456-5671-4e8e-83fd-684c012fef8c','9d72d7ac-a2a2-42cf-b880-5859316d840c'])
tips[3]=('Evaluate skill and memory changes on complete jobs','Define tasks and accepted completion before comparing bundles. Keep partial credit separate from binary pass criteria, and state the attempt budget and output-selection costs behind pass@k. Eight-to-four skills is an experiment, not a universal default.',['4607dbbe-8f94-4b0e-91ce-257d1cfb5448'])
tips[4]=('Calibrate judges as configured system components','Keep safety, task, and experience measures separate. Version the judge model and rubric; measure severe false passes, false failures, disagreement, and repeated-run variance. A fail-leaning judge can increase review burden.',['e4ca10c6-c8b4-427b-a337-8d2a28e2a7aa','4add802c-6a68-4e9c-93fb-9c1e017193bc'])
tips[7]=('Package domain judgment into reviewed skills','Use Range’s recorded Pick–Teach–Pack–Test–Ship sequence to expose inputs, why, required questions, and limits. Test accepted analysis quality and correction effort; parallel drafting does not by itself establish autonomous advice or capacity gains.',['9b002687-09cf-42e2-9282-532ed9d0c184'])
fields=[('coverage','Actual attendance and coverage gaps','Sessions attended, sources checked, sessions missed, and perspectives still missing.'),('findings','Three strongest learnings','Finding → mechanism → evidence shown → limitation → why it matters.'),('changed','What changed my view','Initial hypothesis → evidence from the talk → revised conclusion.'),('examples','Most useful firm examples','Named firm, workflow, maturity, what people still do, outcome evidence, and source.'),('peertips','Practical tips worth sharing','Three techniques, where each helps, prerequisites, and tradeoffs.'),('questions','Unresolved questions','Claim to verify, missing denominator/baseline, artifact needed, and follow-up question.'),('implications','Implications for our team','What to watch, investigate, share, or test. Separate our inference from the speaker’s result.'),('followup','Follow-up and owners','Public materials, proposed discussion or experiment, owner to agree, and date.')]
